(text "RK3568 USB PHY SUPPLIES — each rail bead-isolated from RK809 LDO source; place 100nF + bulk capacitor at SoC pins." (at 35 45 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)))
(text "USB3 HOST1 — DP/DM 2.2R; RX 0R; TX 100nF series coupling; ESD5341N at connector. Keep SS pairs 90R differential." (at 190 45 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)))
(text "USB-C J3 — fixed UFP / USB2 recovery only. CC1/CC2 each Rd=5.1k; do not source VBUS. VBUSDET divider 21.0k/30.1k gives 3.0V at 5V." (at 260 225 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left)))
(text "USB3 OTG0 SuperSpeed pairs and ID are intentionally unused; only USB2 D+/D- and VBUSDET are routed for Rockchip download/recovery." (at 260 340 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left)))
